{
    "category": "hobby",
    "icon": "tool",
    "name": { "fr": "Outillage d'atelier", "en": "Workshop tools" },
    "summary": {
        "fr": "Gardez la trace de votre outillage : marque, modèle, numéro de série, état, rangement, prix d'achat, facture et photos, et sachez qui a emprunté quoi.",
        "en": "Keep track of your tools: brand, model, serial number, condition, storage spot, purchase price, invoice and photos, and know who borrowed what."
    },
    "description": {
        "fr": [
            "Ce modèle est fait pour les bricoleurs, les artisans et les ateliers partagés qui veulent savoir ce qu'ils possèdent et où c'est rangé. Chaque outil a une catégorie, une marque et un modèle, un numéro de série, un état, une alimentation et un rangement.",
            "Gardez la facture et la notice au format PDF dans le champ prévu : c'est utile pour une réparation sous garantie ou pour commander une pièce détachée. Les photos aident à reconnaître un outil au premier coup d'œil, et à prouver son existence en cas de vol.",
            "Astuces : renseignez « Prêté à » et « Prêté le » dès qu'un outil quitte l'atelier, puis filtrez la colonne « Prêté à » pour voir ce qui est dehors. Filtrez sur l'état « À réparer » avant une journée de travaux, et affichez le total de la colonne « Prix d'achat » pour savoir ce que représente votre équipement."
        ],
        "en": [
            "This template is made for DIYers, craftspeople and shared workshops who want to know what they own and where it is stored. Each tool has a category, a brand and model, a serial number, a condition, a power source and a storage spot.",
            "Keep the invoice and the manual as PDFs in the matching field: handy for a warranty repair or to order a spare part. Photos help you recognize a tool at a glance, and prove it exists if it is ever stolen.",
            "Tips: fill in \"Lent to\" and \"Lent on\" as soon as a tool leaves the workshop, then filter the \"Lent to\" column to see what is out. Filter on the \"Needs repair\" condition before a day of work, and show the total of the \"Purchase price\" column to see what your equipment represents."
        ]
    },
    "fields": [
        { "key": "name", "type": "text", "name": { "fr": "Outil", "en": "Tool" }, "required": true },
        {
            "key": "category",
            "type": "select",
            "name": { "fr": "Catégorie", "en": "Category" },
            "options": {
                "choices": [
                    { "key": "hand", "label": { "fr": "Outils à main", "en": "Hand tools" }, "color": "orange" },
                    {
                        "key": "power",
                        "label": { "fr": "Outillage électroportatif", "en": "Power tools" },
                        "color": "red"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "measuring",
                        "label": { "fr": "Mesure et traçage", "en": "Measuring and marking" },
                        "color": "blue"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "fastening",
                        "label": { "fr": "Fixation et serrage", "en": "Fastening and clamping" },
                        "color": "indigo"
                    },
                    { "key": "garden", "label": { "fr": "Jardin", "en": "Garden" }, "color": "green" },
                    { "key": "safety", "label": { "fr": "Protection", "en": "Safety gear" }, "color": "yellow" },
                    { "key": "consumables", "label": { "fr": "Consommables", "en": "Consumables" }, "color": "gray" }
                ]
            }
        },
        { "key": "brand_model", "type": "text", "name": { "fr": "Marque et modèle", "en": "Brand and model" } },
        {
            "key": "serial",
            "type": "barcode",
            "name": { "fr": "Numéro de série", "en": "Serial number" },
            "options": { "format": "any" }
        },
        {
            "key": "condition",
            "type": "select",
            "name": { "fr": "État", "en": "Condition" },
            "options": {
                "choices": [
                    { "key": "new", "label": { "fr": "Neuf", "en": "New" }, "color": "green" },
                    { "key": "good", "label": { "fr": "Bon état", "en": "Good" }, "color": "teal" },
                    { "key": "worn", "label": { "fr": "Usé", "en": "Worn" }, "color": "yellow" },
                    { "key": "repair", "label": { "fr": "À réparer", "en": "Needs repair" }, "color": "red" }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "key": "power",
            "type": "select",
            "name": { "fr": "Alimentation", "en": "Power source" },
            "options": {
                "choices": [
                    { "key": "manual", "label": { "fr": "Manuel", "en": "Manual" }, "color": "gray" },
                    { "key": "corded", "label": { "fr": "Filaire (secteur)", "en": "Corded" }, "color": "blue" },
                    { "key": "battery", "label": { "fr": "Sur batterie", "en": "Battery" }, "color": "green" },
                    { "key": "engine", "label": { "fr": "Thermique", "en": "Combustion engine" }, "color": "orange" },
                    { "key": "pneumatic", "label": { "fr": "Pneumatique", "en": "Pneumatic" }, "color": "purple" }
                ]
            }
        },
        { "key": "location", "type": "text", "name": { "fr": "Rangement", "en": "Storage spot" } },
        { "key": "purchase_date", "type": "date", "name": { "fr": "Date d'achat", "en": "Purchase date" } },
        {
            "key": "price",
            "type": "money",
            "name": { "fr": "Prix d'achat", "en": "Purchase price" },
            "options": { "currency": "EUR" }
        },
        { "key": "lent_to", "type": "text", "name": { "fr": "Prêté à", "en": "Lent to" } },
        { "key": "lent_on", "type": "date", "name": { "fr": "Prêté le", "en": "Lent on" } },
        {
            "key": "photos",
            "type": "photo",
            "name": { "fr": "Photos", "en": "Photos" },
            "options": { "max_files": 3 }
        },
        {
            "key": "documents",
            "type": "file",
            "name": { "fr": "Facture et notice", "en": "Invoice and manual" },
            "options": { "max_files": 3 }
        }
    ],
